    "threshold_justification": "Musco 2019 (arXiv:1809.02127): the threshold is SHAPE-dependent, ~0.4-0.6 in RD; YBS19 quote delta_c = 0.55 for a Gaussian profile; Choudhury et al. scan {0.4, 0.5, 0.6}. Baseline C_th = 0.5 for the broad lognormal peak used here; all values < C_max = f(w) = 2/3 as Eq. 64 requires.",
